.TH "str2str" "1" "" "" "Pocket SDR"
.SH NAME
str2str \- Stream converter / forwarder (RTKLIB\-derived)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
str2str [\-in stream[#format]] [\-out stream[#format] ...] [options]
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Console version of the RTKLIB stream server.
Reads from one input stream and forwards to multiple output streams.
Optionally converts between formats (e.g.\ raw → RTCM3) using \f[CR]\-msg\f[R].
If \f[CR]\-in\f[R] or \f[CR]\-out\f[R] is omitted, stdin or stdout is used.
To stop, send Ctrl\-C (or \f[CR]SIGINT\f[R] for a background process).
.PP
The full option list is long; only the most\-used options are summarized below.
For the complete list, run \f[CR]str2str \-h\f[R].
